        <div class="ab-info-box">
          <div class="xr-eyebrow">The Problem We're Solving</div>
          <p>Mining companies, and junior explorers above all, rarely have the time, people, or money for the large-scale data analytics their projects need. Decades of geological data exist, but in a cluttered form no AI model can use <span class="xr-nobreak">as-is</span>. We collected that data, cleaned and sorted it, and built proprietary featuresets that indicate lithium mineralization.</p>
